 border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#92400e;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">If you do not resubmit before March 15, 2026, your protocol will be automatically marked as <strong>EXPIRED</strong> and will require renewal before it can be used.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://app.cnersh.org/protocols/abc-123" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Renew Protocol</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Once resubmitted, your protocol will go through the standard review process. Upon approval, a new 12-month validity period will begin.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e5e7eb;margin:24px 0"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:24px;color:#9ca3af;text-align:center;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">CNERSH — Commité National d&#x27;Éthique de la Recherche pour la Santé Humaine</p></td></tr><